{"thread":{"threadID":1581,"boardID":23,"topic":"Neue RoundEndSounds?","time":1393158715,"userID":1286,"username":"TeeJay","lastPostTime":1394285695,"lastPoster":"TeeJay","replies":10,"views":1103,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[{"tagID":176,"name":"Vorschlag"}],"posts":[{"postID":15295,"threadID":1581,"userID":1286,"username":"TeeJay","subject":"Neue RoundEndSounds?","time":1393158715,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich hätte da ne Liste mit neuen RoundEndSounds, die kann ich hier auch später hinzufügen, bin nur grad mit Handy on.<br>Ich dachte, der Jailserver könnte ein paar neue Sounds gebrauchen. <br>Mehr dazu um 3</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":15298,"threadID":1581,"userID":1302,"username":"Noahx3","subject":"","time":1393159015,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Gute Idea</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":15301,"threadID":1581,"userID":1286,"username":"TeeJay","subject":"","time":1393167675,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Es handelt sich hierbei um 44 RES mit einer ungefähren Durchschnittslänge von 15sec (wusste nicht, wie lang sie sein müssen). Hört ma rein, oderkommt aufn TS zu meinem MusikBot, der lässt die RES grade durchlaufen. Und sagt mir, was noch geändert werden soll, was weg soll. Hautse rein, Leuts!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.file-upload.net/download-8650014/RoundEndSounds.zip.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Kam ne .zip Datei geflogen</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":15481,"threadID":1581,"userID":1361,"username":"Infinity97","subject":"","time":1394195984,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wäre auch dafür die Roundendsounds auf die umzuändern Gefallen mir besser als die jetzigen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":15494,"threadID":1581,"userID":1347,"username":"HaveFun","subject":"","time":1394221515,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich würde vorschlagen immer die aktuellen Charthits jeden Monat zu aktualisieren...<br>Wie klingt das?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MFG<br>HaveFun</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":15496,"threadID":1581,"userID":1286,"username":"TeeJay","subject":"","time":1394223100,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Würde sich einrichten lassen, aber willst du unbedingt Wrecking Ball als RES?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":15497,"threadID":1581,"userID":363,"username":"stabiler Panda","subject":"","time":1394224426,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>NEIN HALT STOP KEIN MILEY CYRIS KEIN JUSTIN BIEBER HALT STOP !</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Sorry ^^Musste sein</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":15505,"threadID":1581,"userID":1347,"username":"HaveFun","subject":"","time":1394240122,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>habe gesagt 1x im monat und 1x im monat kommen mehr lieder als justing bieber <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":15507,"threadID":1581,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","subject":"","time":1394276312,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ist zwar schöne Idee allerdings auch sehr aufwendig.<br>Für ein komplettes RES-&quot;Paket&quot; braucht man 30-40 Sounds. Diese müssen alle manuell geschnitten und auf die richtige Bitrate gesamplet werden.<br>Daher denke ich, dass es absolut in Ordnung ist wenn wir nur alle paar Monate die RES erneuern.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MfG</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>BlackFire</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":15510,"threadID":1581,"userID":1302,"username":"Noahx3","subject":"","time":1394277625,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Yeaaah</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":15517,"threadID":1581,"userID":1286,"username":"TeeJay","subject":"","time":1394285695,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Dann sollte man mir bitte mal Bitrate, Format und genaue Länge eines res nennen.</p>","polls":[]}]}